  "tha-ap322:1.1": "Usabhaṃ pavaraṃ vīraṃ ",
  "tha-ap322:1.2": "mahesiṃ vijitāvinaṃ / ",
  "tha-ap322:1.3": "Vipassinaṃ mahāvīram ",
  "tha-ap322:1.4": "abh*ijātaṃ va kesariṃ // // ",
  "tha-ap322:2.1": "Rathiyaṃ paṭipajjantam* ",
  "tha-ap322:2.2": "āhutīnaṃ paṭiggahaṃ / ",
  "tha-ap322:2.3": "gahetvā kumudaṃ mālaṃ ",
  "tha-ap322:2.4": "Buddhaseṭṭhaṃ samokiriṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap322:3.1": "Ekanavute ito kappe ",
  "tha-ap322:3.2": "yaṃ puppham abhipūjayiṃ / ",
  "tha-ap322:3.3": "duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi ",
  "tha-ap322:3.4": "Buddhapūjāy' idaṃ phalaṃ. // // ",
  "tha-ap322:4.1": "Paṭisambhidā . . . ",
  "tha-ap322:4.2": "pe . . . ",
  "tha-ap322:4.3": "pe . . . // // ",
  "tha-ap322:5.1": "Itthaṃ sudam āyasmā Kumudamāliyo thero i. g. a- ti. Kumudamāliyattherassa ",
  "tha-ap322:6.1": "",
  "tha-ap322:7.1": "apadānaṃ samattaṃ. ",
  "tha-ap322:8.1": "Uddānaṃ: ",
  "tha-ap322:9.1": "Ārakkhado Bhojanado ",
  "tha-ap322:9.2": "Gatasaññī ca Padumiko ",
  "tha-ap322:9.3": "*Pu*pphāsanī Santhavako ",
  "tha-ap322:9.4": "Saddasaññī Tiraṃsiyo ",
  "tha-ap322:9.5": "Kandalī Komudī c' eva ",
  "tha-ap322:9.6": "sattapaññāsa gāthakā. Āra*kkha*dāyavaggo battiṃsatimo. "
